                <section class="mouser-pattern-hero"><div class="mouser-shell"><h1>The TTI Family of Specialists</h1></div></section>
                <main class="tti-original-content">
                    <section class="tti-white"><div class="tti-page-container"><h2>About TTI, Inc.</h2><hr/><p>TTI, Inc., a Berkshire Hathaway company, is a global specialty distributor of electronic components, serving procurement professionals with deep inventory and reliable service. Founded in 1971, TTI has built a reputation for excellence by focusing exclusively on interconnect, passive, electromechanical, and discrete semiconductor components.</p><p>With more than 8,000 employees and over 136 locations across the Americas, Europe, Asia and Africa, TTI provides unmatched product availability and supply chain expertise. The company’s commitment to quality, precision, and customer satisfaction has made it a trusted partner for manufacturers in industrial, transportation, aerospace, defence, medical, and communications sectors.</p></div></section>
                    <section class="tti-grey"><div class="tti-page-container"><h2>What sets TTI apart</h2><ul><li><b>Specialised Focus:</b> Dedicated exclusively to IP&amp;E components for maximum product depth and expertise.</li><li><b>Deep Inventory:</b> Industry-leading availability of components from trusted manufacturers.</li><li><b>Global Infrastructure:</b> Over 275,000 square metres of certified warehouse space across three continents.</li><li><b>Quality Assurance:</b> ISO-certified facilities and proprietary systems ensure accuracy and reliability.</li><li><b>Customer Commitment:</b> Built on a philosophy of delivering the right parts, on time, every time.</li><li><b>Culture of Integrity:</b> A workplace defined by honesty, kindness, and continuous improvement.</li><li><b>Responsible Practices:</b> Committed to environmental stewardship and ethical business operations.</li><li><b>Industry Insight:</b> Sharing technical knowledge through expert content.</li></ul></div></section>
                    <section class="tti-white"><div class="tti-page-container"><h2>The TTI family of specialists</h2><p>TTI is part of the TTI Family of Specialists, which includes Mouser Electronics, Sager Electronics, and the Exponential Technology Group. Together, these companies offer customers access to the latest technologies, specialised services, and a global distribution network.</p><hr/><h4>Mouser Electronics</h4><p>Mouser Electronics is a globally authorised distributor of semiconductors and electronic components for over 1,200 industry-leading manufacturer brands, specialising in the rapid introduction of the newest products and technologies targeting the design engineer and buyer communities.</p><hr/><h4>Sager Electronics</h4><p>Grounded in over 135 years of innovation and service, Sager Electronics is a North American electronic component distributor of interconnect, power and electromechanical electronic components and a provider of custom solutions. Our Distributing Confidence® business model goes beyond fulfilment to provide our customers and suppliers a unique combination of operational excellence and innovative business solutions.</p><hr/><h4>Exponential Technology Group (XTG)</h4><p>The Exponential Technology Group (XTG) is a collection of companies specialising in the design-in and supply of component technologies that enable modern electronic systems from automotive and communication applications to the internet of things (IoT). The companies within XTG maintain their own areas of expertise and focus and collaborate to deliver total solutions to their common customers.</p></div></section>
