                        <h1>Real Products. Trusted Source.</h1>
                        <p>It is critical that engineers know the electronic components in their designs are authentic. Order with confidence - Mouser ensures our customers receive authorised, authentic components directly from the original manufacturers. Mouser customers can trust that we have the most stringent product traceability and anti-counterfeit controls in place - ensuring the delivery of 100% genuine electronic components.</p>

                        <h2>AS9100D &amp; AS9120B ISO9001:2015 Registered Distributor</h2>
                        <p>Mouser is a coveted AS9120B certified distributor, securing the supply chain for aviation, space, and defense industries. It is based on the ISO9001:2015 quality management system standard and includes requirements for aviation, space, and defense. This establishes high-level traceability, and anti-counterfeit controls apply for every electronic component stocked and shipped. Mouser is also AS9100D certified for the renewal of Moisture Sensitive Level (MSL) electronic components.</p>

                        <h2>SAE AS6496 Accredited Distributor</h2>
                        <p>Mouser is the first distributor to be accredited as fully meeting the stringent requirements of the SAE AS6496 standard for anti-counterfeit measures in authorised electronic component distribution. AS6496 sets requirements for the avoidance, detection, mitigation and disposition of counterfeit products in the authorised distribution supply chain. Overall, meeting this standard means we can provide full traceability to the original manufacturers on every product we stock and sell.</p>

                        <h2>ECIA Authorised Distributor</h2>
                        <p>As a member of ECIA (Electronic Components Industry Association), Mouser is dedicated to providing factory-warranted, first-quality, genuine components – adhering to the highest standards in customer service. Additionally, we are a member of <a href="https://www.trustedparts.com/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TrustedParts.com</a>, which allows you to leverage the strength of authorised industry partnerships, ensuring 100% peace of mind, flexibility, selection, and excellent customer service.</p>
                        <p>The mission of ECIA is to promote and improve the business environment for the authorised sale of electronic components. Dedicated to the enhancement of the distributor-manufacturer relationship, this association represents companies involved in the distribution of electronic components and parts, computer and computer peripheral components, and test, measurement, and control equipment and their manufacturers.</p>
                        <p>Purchasing through Mouser means:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>The products have been obtained directly from the manufacturers or from their authorised channels</li>
                            <li>The products have been handled and stored in accordance with industry quality standards</li>
                            <li>Full access to our manufacturers' full range of up-to-date technical and product information, as well as comprehensive technical support</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>
